Third-party material
--------------------

The Docker image this repository publishes also contains software that
this project neither wrote nor distributes in source form here: the
Debian base image, postfix, opendkim and opendkim-tools, postsrsd,
rsyslog, sasl2-bin, libsasl2-modules, libpam-pwdfile, whois, procps,
perl, openssl and ca-certificates, each under its own licence. They are
aggregated with this program, not derived from it, and their terms are
the ones shipped inside the image itself, under /usr/share/doc.


